```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>QPG Logo</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        background: #111827;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .logo {
        width: 300px;
        height: 300px;
        border-radius: 70px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #2563eb);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .logo::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 220px;
        height: 220px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        top: -70px;
        right: -60px;
    }

    .logo::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 180px;
        height: 180px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        bottom: -80px;
        left: -50px;
    }

    .letters {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        color: white;
        font-size: 86px;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -7px;
        text-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .name {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 38px;
        z-index: 3;
        color: white;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="logo">
    <div class="letters">QPG</div>
    <div class="name">QUICK PLAYABLE GAMES</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
